; music-insonation-lanes-band.fk — what a body receives from music, and which planes
; this host can carry from it tonight.
;
; preludes: form-stdlib/core.fk observe/music-insonation-lanes.fk
;
; Band verdict 255 when, on Go / Rust / TypeScript / fkwu:
;     1  250 Hz — the pitch the mac ear measured in the room — is 6160 mm in body water
;     2  which is 3.52 standing bodies long (x1000)
;     4  so no pattern of nodes forms inside a person at that pitch
;     8  three of the seven planes are witnessed by organs running on this host
;    16  exactly one lane is belief-kind, and it is "why"
;    32  the lyric lane answers -1 — the channel is dark, so it invents no words
;    64  a witnessed lane answers with its own number
;   128  an evidence lane and a belief lane do not blend
;
; The teaching the numbers carry: audible music does not draw figures inside a body.
; A Chladni plate patterns because its wavelengths fit inside its boundary; at 250 Hz
; the wave in tissue is metres long and a person stands inside a single phase, moved
; whole rather than divided into nodes. The water is real, the pressure is real, the
; cymatic picture of it is belief — and this cell keeps those two apart by construction,
; not by disclaimer.

(do
    (music-insonation-check))
